exports[`Campaigns in dark > renders live-stopped 1`] = `
"<div class="mb-grid flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2"><h1 class="type-display">veterinary practices in Orkney</h1></header><ol aria-label="Where this campaign is" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Brief</li><li data-testid="state-step" aria-current="step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">Researching · stopped</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Plan ready</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Finding people</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Drafting</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Running</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Done</li></ol></div></div><div class="mb-grid"><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card max-w-[760px]"><p class="type-small mb-3 rounded-input bg-warn-bg px-3 py-2.5 text-warn">Not enough evidence to write a plan. Nothing has been spent.</p><p data-testid="stop-reason" class="type-body mb-4">Orkney contains two veterinary organisations, not ten. Orkney.com's own guidance says "Orkney has two veterinary practices"; the Scottish Government's HIVSS list shows the same two; directories' "four practices" figure counts Northvet's three premises separately. The floor is three kinds of buyer with two seed firms each inside the scope — six distinct firms. Two exist, and a firm may be one seed only.

Size compounds it. Northvet, the larger, publishes 8 reception/administration staff out of ~32 employees; Flett &amp; Carmichael is single-site and publishes no staff count. The product is built for 5–250 contact-centre seats and the knowledge set excludes sub-5-seat operations outright, so at best one of the two clears the floor, and only just, against a £1,280 setup fee plus a £640 configuration review.

The sector is not wrong — the CMA's 23 September 2026 Orders deadline is a real GB-wide clock on veterinary client communication. The geography is smaller than the smallest viable campaign.</p><div class="grid gap-grid wide:grid-cols-2"><div><h3 class="type-label mb-1.5">What it did find</h3><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">a guess</span><span class="type-small">The product knowledge set names sub-five-seat operations as an explicit exclusion from the ideal customer profile, on the grounds that per-seat price against the one-off setup fee is not commercially viable for either side.<span class="type-small block text-muted">No source. Relay inferred this from Knowledge article 'icp', section 'Not our ICP (explicit exclusions)', read this run.</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">a guess</span><span class="type-small">The product is built for operations running between 5 and 250 contact-centre seats.<span class="type-small block text-muted">No source. Relay inferred this from Knowledge articles 'overview' and 'icp', read this run.</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small">Orkney has two veterinary practices, both offering an out-of-hours emergency service: Flett &amp; Carmichael and Northvet.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.orkney.com/news/dog-friendly-orkney" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">orkney.com</a></span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">a guess</span><span class="type-small">Commercial veterinary directories list four veterinary premises in Orkney: Northvet's Junction Road (Kirkwall), Lammaquoy (Harray) and North End Road (Stromness) sites, plus Flett &amp; Carmichael at Hatston Veterinary Centre Ltd, Kirkwall.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://vetpricecomparisonsite.co.uk/vets-in/kirkwall" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">vetpricecomparisonsite.co.uk</a> +2 · 30 Aug 2026</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small">Northvet Veterinary Group's own business listing states it has 7 veterinary surgeons, 3 veterinary nurses, an animal nursing assistant, a practice manager and 8 reception/administration staff, across three branch surgeries covering all of Orkney including the outer isles.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.orkney.com/listings/northvet-veterinary-group" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">orkney.com</a></span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">moderate</span><span class="type-small">Flett &amp; Carmichael Veterinary Surgeons operates from a single Kirkwall address at Garrison Road, Hatston Industrial Estate, KW15 1GN, open Monday to Friday 8.45am–6pm and Saturday 9am–12 noon, with a 24-hour emergency service, covering small animal, farm and equine work.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.flettandcarmichael.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">flettandcarmichael.co.uk</a> +1</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small">The Scottish Government's Highlands and Islands Veterinary Services Scheme list of participating island practices shows three Orkney entries — Northvet Veterinary Group at Lamaquoy, Harray; Flett and Carmichael Veterinary Surgeons at Garrison Road, Hatston Industrial Estate, Kirkwall; and Northvet Veterinary Group at 33 Junction Road, Kirkwall.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.gov.scot/publications/highlands-and-islands-veterinary-services-scheme-participating-island-practices" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">gov.scot</a> · 31 Jul 2026</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">moderate</span><span class="type-small">The CMA concluded its market investigation into veterinary services for household pets with a final decision report published 24 March 2026; the next stage gives the CMA six months to put legally binding Orders on businesses in place and to accept undertakings from the RCVS, so these will be in place by 23 September 2026.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.gov.uk/government/news/cma-concludes-market-investigation-with-major-reforms-to-veterinary-sector" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">gov.uk</a> +1 · 24 Mar 2026</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small">There are around 1,500 businesses based in Orkney, with more than 90% employing fewer than 10 people.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.orkney.com/life/live/start-a-business" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">orkney.com</a></span></span></div></div><fieldset class="min-w-0"><legend class="type-label mb-1.5">What would help</legend><ul class="grid gap-chips"><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the region · option 1</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Keep veterinary practices, drop Orkney, and run the brief across Great Britain. The CMA's 23 September 2026 Orders on client communication apply to every GB veterinary business, and the corporate veterinary groups run central client-contact teams at the seat sizes the product is built for.</span><span data-testid="widen-becomes" class="type-small mt-1 block">Where becomes United Kingdom</span></li><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the region · option 2</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Keep Orkney and add the rest of the Scottish islands and Highlands. The Scottish Government's HIVSS list names practices in Shetland, Lewis and Harris, Uist, Skye, Islay, Mull and Tiree alongside the Orkney two — same 24/7 island obligation, same scheme, same CMA deadline, roughly ten organisations instead of two.</span><span data-testid="widen-becomes" class="type-small mt-1 block">Where becomes United Kingdom, Orkney, Shetland, Western Isles, Highland, Argyll and Bute</span></li><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the kind of organisation</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Stay in Orkney and drop the veterinary-only filter. Orkney has around 1,500 businesses and a council employing over a thousand people; the question becomes which Orkney employers run a multi-seat phone desk with recorded calls, rather than which vets do. Expect a short list either way.</span><span data-testid="widen-becomes" class="type-small mt-1 block">Kinds of organisation becomes open, for Relay to decide</span></li></ul><p data-testid="widen-note" class="type-small mt-2 text-muted">Choose one, and Relay looks again</p></fieldset></div></section></div><div class="grid gap-grid wide:grid-cols-campaign"><div class="grid content-start gap-grid"><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">The brief</h2><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Motion</dt><dd class="type-small">Direct</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Who</dt><dd class="type-small">veterinary practices in Orkney</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Where</dt><dd class="type-small">United Kingdom, Orkney (also Orkney Islands, Kirkwall, Stromness)</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Kinds of organisation</dt><dd class="type-small">veterinary practice</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">How many</dt><dd class="type-small">10 people over 3 weeks</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Channels</dt><dd class="type-small">Email</dd></div></dl><div class="mt-3"><a data-testid="edit-brief" class="inline-flex min-h-6 items-center rounded-pill text-13 font-semibold text-action focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2" href="/campaigns/camp-stopped/edit">Edit brief</a></div></section></div><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">Ask Relay</h2><p class="type-small mb-2.5 text-muted">Six questions, answered from what Relay already knows.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-chips"><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">How is this campaign going?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">What is waiting on me?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">How many have replied, and how?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">When does the next batch go?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">What has this cost?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">Why is this paused or stopped?</button></div></section></div></div><div class="grid content-start gap-grid"><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">Progress</h2><p data-testid="progress-none" class="type-small text-muted">No people have been found yet. Nothing has been sent.</p></section></div><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">People</h2><p class="type-small text-muted">Chosen after you confirm. You pick from the ranked list before any credit is spent.</p></section></div></div></div>"
