exports[`Campaigns in dark > renders page-plan-ready as signed 1`] = `"<div class="mb-grid flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2"><h1 class="type-display">Managed print partners, Midlands</h1></header><ol aria-label="Where this campaign is" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Brief</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Researching</li><li data-testid="state-step" aria-current="step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-action text-on-action">Plan ready</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Finding people</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Drafting</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Running</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Done</li></ol></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-transparent bg-action text-on-action">Confirm plan</button></div></div><div class="grid gap-grid wide:grid-cols-campaign"><div class="grid content-start gap-grid"><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">The plan, and the research behind it</h2><div class="grid gap-chips wide:grid-cols-2"><div data-testid="plan-card" class="rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Who we found</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">The people who feel it are claims operations leads with twenty to sixty handlers and no way to see a week's calls at once.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 2 groups · 16 sources</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">The hook</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Your complaints are up and the calls behind them are unread. Read all of them instead of one in fifty.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 1 reason it is now</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Their pain, in their words</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Claims teams in mid-sized UK insurers are reading every call by hand and finding the same three problems too late.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 7 shown</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Seed firms and who to target</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Northgate Claims Services, Westbury Mutual, Calder Insurance Group, Penrith Underwriting</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 4 firms</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 border-dashed"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">What Relay could not find</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Nothing found on what these teams currently spend on quality checking.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 1 unknown · nothing is guessed here</span></button></div></div><dl class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 border-t border-line pt-3"><div data-testid="plan-fact" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">People</dt><dd class="type-small">15 from 6 companies · 3 per company at most</dd></div><div data-testid="plan-fact" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Credits</dt><dd class="type-small">15 reveals, about 15 of your 162 left</dd></div><div data-testid="plan-fact" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Sending</dt><dd class="type-small">4 a day, 09:00 to 16:30 · from rep@example.test</dd></div><div data-testid="plan-fact" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Lawful basis</dt><dd class="type-small">Legitimate interest recorded at confirm: B2B offer, opt out in every email</dd></div></dl></section></div><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">The brief</h2><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Motion</dt><dd class="type-small">Channel</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Who</dt><dd class="type-small">Managed print dealers in the Midlands who resell service contracts. MD or Sales Director.</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Where</dt><dd class="type-small">United Kingdom</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">How many</dt><dd class="type-small">15 people over 4 weeks</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Channels</dt><dd class="type-small">Email</dd></div></dl></section></div><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">Ask Relay</h2><p class="type-small mb-2.5 text-muted">Six questions, answered from what Relay already knows.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-chips"><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">How is this campaign going?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">What is waiting on me?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">How many have replied, and how?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">When does the next batch go?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">What has this cost?</button