d shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">The brief</h2><p class="type-small text-muted">Direct · call handling · 20 people over 3 weeks · email + LinkedIn</p></section></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`Campaigns in light > renders page-stopped as signed 1`] = `"<div class="mb-grid flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2"><h1 class="type-display">Vets, Scotland</h1></header><ol aria-label="Where this campaign is" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Brief</li><li data-testid="state-step" aria-current="step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">Researching · stopped</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Plan ready</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Finding people</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Drafting</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Running</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Done</li></ol></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-transparent bg-action text-on-action">Widen the brief</button></div></div><div class="mb-grid"><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card max-w-[760px]"><p class="type-small mb-3 rounded-input bg-warn-bg px-3 py-2.5 text-warn">Not enough evidence to write a plan. Nothing has been spent.</p><p data-testid="stop-reason" class="type-body mb-4">Too few independent practices of this size in Scotland show any sign of the pain.</p><div class="grid gap-grid wide:grid-cols-2"><div><h3 class="type-label mb-1.5">What it did find</h3><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small">Three independent practices with four to six sites, all three listing out of hours triage as a service.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://vettimes.co.uk/a/found-triage" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">vettimes.co.uk</a> · 2 Jun 2026</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">a guess</span><span class="type-small">No trade press and no hiring anywhere in the last twelve months for practices of this size.<span class="type-small block text-muted">No source. Relay inferred this from eleven searches that returned nothing datable</span></span></div></div><fieldset class="min-w-0"><legend class="type-label mb-1.5">What would help</legend><ul class="grid gap-chips"><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the region</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Look at the whole of the United Kingdom rather than Scotland alone.</span></li><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the size</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Look at every practice with three or more sites rather than four to six.</span></li><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the kind of organisation</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Look at practice groups as well as independent practices.</span></li></ul><p data-testid="widen-note" class="type-small mt-2 text-muted">Choose one, and Relay looks again</p></fieldset></div></section></div><div class="grid gap-grid wide:grid-cols-campaign"><div class="grid content-start gap-grid"><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">The brief</h2><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Motion</dt><dd class="type-small">Direct</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Who</dt><dd class="type-small">Practice owners at independent vets in Scotland</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Where</dt><dd class="type-small">United Kingdom</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">How many</dt><dd class="type-small">20 people over 3 weeks</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Channels</dt><dd class="type-small">Email</dd></div></dl></section></div><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">Ask Relay</h2><p class="type-small mb-2.5 text-muted">Six questions, answered from what Relay already knows.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-chips"><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">How is this campaign going?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">What is waiting on me?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">How many have replied, and how?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">When does the next batch go?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">What has this cost?</button><button type="button" data-testid="ask-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-ground text-muted hover:text-ink">Why is this paused or stopped?</button></div></section></div></div><div class="grid content-start gap-grid"><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">Progress</h2><dl class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2"><div data-testid="progress-count" class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-input border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-center"><dt class="type-small text-muted">found</dt><dd class="type-mono-big">0</dd></div><div data-testid="progress-count" class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-input border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-center"><dt class="type-small text-muted">drafted</dt><dd class="type-mono-big">0</dd></div><div data-testid="progress-count" class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-input border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-center"><dt class="type-small text-muted">approved</dt><dd class="type-mono-big">0</dd></div><div data-testid="progress-count" class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-input border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-center"><dt class="type-small text-muted">sent</dt><dd class="type-mono-big">0</dd></div><div data-testid="progress-count" class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-input border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-center"><dt class="type-small text-muted">replied</dt><dd class="type-mono-big">0</dd></div></dl></section></div><div><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">People</h2><p class="type-small text-muted">Chosen after you confirm. You pick from the ranked list before any credit is spent.</p></section></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`Campaigns in light > renders start as signed 1`] = `"<header class="mb-grid flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><h1 class="type-display">New campaign</h1><p class="type-mono text-13 text-muted">step 2 of 2</p></header><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card mx-auto max-w-[760px]"><p class="type-label mb-1">Who do you want to reach, and why now?</p><div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border-control border-line bg-ground py-1.5 pl-4 pr-1.5"><input aria-label="Who do you want to reach, and why now?" placeholder="Managed print dealers in the Midlands who resell service contracts" class="type-small flex-1 bg-transparent focus-visible:outline-none" value=""><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-0 bg-transparent text-muted px-2.5">Read it</button></div><p class="type-small mb-3 text-muted">Here is what Relay understood. Fix anything, then start the research.</p><div class="grid gap-grid wide:grid-cols-2"><div data-testid="start-field"><p class="type-label mb-1">Product</p><select aria-label="Product" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line"><option value="Insights360">Insights360</option></select><p class="type-small mt-1 text-muted">Facts updated 11 Sep, version 2. More products as the knowledge base grows.</p></div><div data-testid="start-field"><p class="type-label mb-1">Motion</p><div class="flex gap-chips rounded-input border-control border-dashed border-muted p-2"><button type="button" data-testid="motion-chip" aria-pressed="true" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent bg-soft text-action">Direct</button><button type="button" data-testid="motion-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-panel text-muted">Channel</button></div><p class="type-small mt-1 text-muted">Not in your sentence, so these are the suggested defaults.</p></div><div data-testid="start-field" class="col-span-full"><p class="type-label mb-1">Who</p><textarea aria-label="Who" placeholder="Managed print dealers in the Midlands who resell service contracts" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line"></textarea></div><div data-testid="start-field"><p class="type-label mb-1">Region</p><select aria-label="Region" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-dashed border-muted"><option value="GB">United Kingdom</option><option value="IE">Ireland</option><option value="US">United States</option></select></div><div data-testid="start-field"><p class="type-label mb-1">How many, over how long</p><div class="flex gap-chips"><select aria-label="people" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-dashed border-muted"><option value="10">10 people</option><option value="20">20 people</option><option value="30">30 people</option><option value="50">50 people</option></select><select aria-label="weeks" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-dashed border-muted"><option value="2">2 weeks</option><option value="3">3 weeks</option><option value="4">4 weeks</option><option value="6">6 weeks</option></select></div><p class="type-small mt-1 text-muted">Not in your sentence, so these are the suggested defaults.</p></div><div data-testid="start-field" class="col-span-full"><p class="type-label mb-1">Channels</p><div class="flex gap-chips rounded-input border-control border-dashed border-muted p-2"><button type="button" data-testid="channel-chip" aria-pressed="true" disabled="" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent bg-soft text-action">Email</button><button type="button" data-testid="channel-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-panel text-muted">LinkedIn</button><button type="button" data-testid="channel-chip" aria-pressed="true" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent bg-soft text-action">Calls</button></div><p class="type-small mt-1 text-muted">Email is always on. Calls adds one day 3 call to each sequence; turn it off if you will not phone.</p></div></div><div data-testid="who-exactly" class="mt-5 border-t border-line pt-4"><p class="type-label mb-1">Who exactly</p><p class="type-small mb-3 text-muted">Only what you add here limits the research. Leave the rest to Relay.</p><div class="grid gap-grid wide:grid-cols-2"><div data-testid="start-field"><p class="type-label mb-1">Also include</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-chips"><button type="button" data-testid="country-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-panel text-muted">Ireland</button><button type="button" data-testid="country-chip" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-pill border px-3 py-1 text-13 transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line bg-panel text-muted">United States</button></div></div><div data-testid="start-field"><p class="type-label mb-1">Size</p><div class="flex gap-chips"><input aria-label="From" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="From" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line" value=""><input aria-label="To" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="To" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line" value=""><select aria-label="Counted in" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line"><option value="employees">people employed</option><option value="seats">seats</option><option value="sites">sites</option></select></div></div><div data-testid="start-field" class="col-span-full"><p class="type-label mb-1">Places</p><div><div class="grid gap-chips wide:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_auto]"><input aria-label="Places" placeholder="Orkney" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line" value=""><input aria-label="Also called" placeholder="Other names, separated by commas" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line" value=""><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action">Add</button></div></div></div><div data-testid="start-field" class="col-span-full"><p class="type-label mb-1">Kinds of organisation</p><div><div class="flex gap-chips"><input aria-label="Kinds of organisation" placeholder="veterinary practice" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line" value=""><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action">Add</button></div></div></div><div data-testid="start-field"><p class="type-label mb-1">Roles to reach</p><div><div class="flex gap-chips"><input aria-label="Roles to reach" placeholder="practice manager" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line" value=""><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action">Add</button></div></div></div><div data-testid="start-field"><p class="type-label mb-1">Roles to leave out</p><div><div class="flex gap-chips"><input aria-label="Roles to leave out" placeholder="practice manager" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line" value=""><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-action bg-transparent text-action">Add</button></div></div></div><div data-testid="start-field" class="col-span-full"><p class="type-label mb-1">Do you already have customers like this? Who, and what did they buy it for?</p><textarea aria-label="Do you already have customers like this? Who, and what did they buy it for?" class="type-small w-full rounded-input border-control bg-panel px-3 py-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-line"></textarea><p class="type-small mt-1 text-muted">Optional. Relay looks for more like them and never names them.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 border-t border-line pt-4"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-transparent bg-action text-on-action" disabled="">Start research</button><span class="type-small text-muted">Usually 20 to 45 minutes. Nothing is bought or sent until you confirm the plan.</span></div></section>"`;
